 # Meet Proxy Chief of Staff
 
+Local candidate **0.4.19-rc.2** adds the shared MCP adapter, context Resources,
+durable-task clarification, and an Agents/Inbox UI for selected-agent invitations,
+shared threads and bilateral severing. See [implementation contracts](docs/MCP-CONTRACTS.md).
+Build with `npm run build:mcp`; run `npm run test:mcp`, `npm test` and
+`npm run test:ui`. This candidate has not been deployed or verified on live native
+hosts. Existing private Chief of Staff mandates retain their separate flow.
+
 The 0.4.18 candidate mirrors each account's whole synced archive to a local
 read-only context folder with a file search command, so any agent answers history
 questions from plain files without a cloud model; see
